      },
      "message": "fix(import): report the height of the kept curved STEP facets\n\nThe curved-face fit (#2600) kept inside edges up to twice the pass\ntolerance and the import reported the tolerance. It now measures every\nedge of the kept facets, inside and boundary, and reports the highest\ntimes a bound for the inside of a facet (1.0 for a cylinder, 1.5 for a\ncone, sphere or torus; Waldron 1998). Inside edges split to\ntol / bound, so the bar fixture stays at full fidelity (0.005 mm).\n\nFixes #2718\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
